cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: article
title: "Perpendicular Mode Geometry of Four Fundamental Forces"
authors:
  - name: "Algorithm Alliance"
    affiliation: "Independent Research"
date: 2026-08-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/algorithm-alliance/perpendicular-mode-geometry"
abstract: >-
  We propose that the four fundamental forces arise from four perpendicular
  oscillation modes of a light-speed helix structure in space. The framework
  derives the gauge coupling ratio alpha_S : alpha_W : alpha_EM = 15 : 4 : 1
  from integer coefficients on a unified base Phi_T^2 = 2^-7.
  The prediction alpha_S/alpha_W = 3.75 (experiment: 3.7959) is falsifiable.
keywords:
  - gauge unification
  - geometric physics
  - four forces
  - fine structure constant
  - perpendicular modes
